  "description": "The Service Course Tri is a master of Olympic and Sprint distance events, with enough speed and versatility to compete in road races or full IRONMANs. With class-leading aerodynamics and race-ready handling, it is the ideal tool for do-it-all triathletes.\nDraft-Legal - Standard drop-bar handlebars and a UCI-legal frame maintain eligibility for draft-legal events\nOptional Clip-On Extensions - Clip-on compatible cockpits to add extensions for middle and long distance events\nAero Headtube - Extended, narrowed, and shaped to reduce frontal area and direct air rearward\nAero Fork - All-new fork design creates efficient airflow around the front tire\nAero Downtube - Deep, aggressive shape reduces turbulence and keeps airflow attached\nWide Tire Clearance - Clearance for tires up to 36mm wide\nUDH - Universal Derailleur Hanger for serviceability and compatibility\nThreaded T47A BB - Silently increases stiffness, serviceability, and reliability",
